{
    "title": "Coding for kids - Racing games",
    "description": "Unleash your child's potential with our new \"Coding Games for Kids: Dinosaur Coding 3\"! This interactive game allows your child to learn the basics of coding while enjoying exciting racing adventures. This unique combination of coding and racing offers an entertaining and educational way for kids to gain essential STEM skills.\r\n\r\nIn this educational coding game, children have the opportunity to dive into two gameplay modes: Coding Mode and Racing Mode. In Coding Mode, kids employ patience and strategy to plan the route and drag command blocks, guiding our little dinosaur to the finish line.\r\n\r\nThe Coding Games for Kids not only focus on programming but also offer an array of levels that cater to various interests and skill levels. With 120 whimsical levels, your child gets to learn coding concepts like sequences, loops, conditions, and more.\r\n\r\nOne of the unique features of this game is the child-oriented instruction blocks. They're designed to simplify programming learning, allowing your child to control car movements easily. This concept lays a solid foundation for understanding sequences, loops, and functions \u2013 the key pillars of coding.\r\n\r\nBy engaging with our game, kids don't just play; they acquire learning and problem-solving skills. They navigate through different environments, exploring the racetrack, desert, ice field, meadow, beach, and volcano.\r\n\r\nDownload our Coding App for Kids and choose from 36 cool vehicles \u2013 police cars, fire trucks, ambulances, monster trucks, race cars, and more \u2013 and engage in six different career activities with the lovable dinosaur character.\r\n\r\nAbout Yateland, we're dedicated to designing apps with an educational purpose. Our aim is to inspire preschoolers across the globe to learn through play. Learn more about Yateland and our apps at https://yateland.com.\r\n\r\nFor a fun and educational gaming experience that equips your child with the essential coding skills needed in the STEM field, download our Coding App for Kids: Dinosaur Coding 3 today!\r\n\r\nPlease be sure to read our privacy policy at https://yateland.com/privacy to understand how we're committed to protecting our users' privacy.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Unleash your child&#39;s potential with our new &quot;Coding Games for Kids: Dinosaur Coding 3&quot;! This interactive game allows your child to learn the basics of coding while enjoying exciting racing adventures. This unique combination of coding and racing offers an entertaining and educational way for kids to gain essential STEM skills.<br><br>In this educational coding game, children have the opportunity to dive into two gameplay modes: Coding Mode and Racing Mode. In Coding Mode, kids employ patience and strategy to plan the route and drag command blocks, guiding our little dinosaur to the finish line.<br><br>The Coding Games for Kids not only focus on programming but also offer an array of levels that cater to various interests and skill levels. With 120 whimsical levels, your child gets to learn coding concepts like sequences, loops, conditions, and more.<br><br>One of the unique features of this game is the child-oriented instruction blocks. They&#39;re designed to simplify programming learning, allowing your child to control car movements easily. This concept lays a solid foundation for understanding sequences, loops, and functions \u2013 the key pillars of coding.<br><br>By engaging with our game, kids don&#39;t just play; they acquire learning and problem-solving skills. They navigate through different environments, exploring the racetrack, desert, ice field, meadow, beach, and volcano.<br><br>Download our Coding App for Kids and choose from 36 cool vehicles \u2013 police cars, fire trucks, ambulances, monster trucks, race cars, and more \u2013 and engage in six different career activities with the lovable dinosaur character.<br><br>About Yateland, we&#39;re dedicated to designing apps with an educational purpose. Our aim is to inspire preschoolers across the globe to learn through play. Learn more about Yateland and our apps at https://yateland.com.<br><br>For a fun and educational gaming experience that equips your child with the essential coding skills needed in the STEM field, download our Coding App for Kids: Dinosaur Coding 3 today!<br><br>Please be sure to read our privacy policy at https://yateland.com/privacy to understand how we&#39;re committed to protecting our users&#39; privacy.",
